      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRAX KEEPING (1) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start sixth (31.79) at this track. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Better than last start and worth following up. ZIPPING WICHITA (4) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 9 lengths at this track (31.67). Speedy beginner who can find the front with a clean break from the middle of the draw. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. BOOM BOOM JACK (8) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (30.89) at Angle Park in a Grade 4/5 over 530m. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Should be in this for a long way. MUNDULLA (2) is right in the mix.",
